ПВО РФ отбила ночной налет беспилотников ВСУ, уничтожено более сотни дронов

"Дежурными средствами ПВО перехвачены и уничтожены 140 украинских беспилотных летательных аппаратов самолетного типа над территориями Белгородской, Брянской, Воронежской, Калужской, Курской, Ростовской областей, Московского региона, Краснодарского края, Республики Крым и над акваториями Азовского и Черного морей," — сообщает Минобороны РФ

@News_See

❗️ Throughout the day, the Armed Forces of the Russian Federation continued carrying out strikes against Ukrainian ports and vessels operating in the interests of the AFU.

💥 Anti-ship Oniks missiles, air-launched cruise missiles, and loitering munitions hit the following port infrastructure targets:

▪️ at the Port of Odessa (the state enterprise ‘Odessa Commercial Sea Port’), a workshop assembling long-range unmanned aerial vehicles and a parking area for fuel tankers;

▪️ at the Port of Yuzhny (the state enterprise ‘Yuzhny Commercial Sea Port’), a warehouse containing military equipment supplied by Western countries for the AFU;

▪️ in the vicinity of Novy Belyary (15 km north-east of the Port of Odessa) – five POL tanks designated for the AFU.

💥 In addition, aircraft of the Russian Aerospace Forces and unmanned aerial vehicles struck:

▪️ Two bulk carriers carrying military cargo at anchorage off the Port of Odessa;

▪️ Two vessels, a bulk carrier and a dry cargo ship, north of Zmeiny Island, from which the AFU had been launching strike unmanned aerial vehicles and uncrewed surface vessels.

🔹 Russian Defence Ministry
